{"unit_id":"tag:04DY:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们给出两个证明。第一个使用下降（descent）的有效性（effectivity），针对拟紧（quasi-compact）、分离（separated）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphisms），相对于满射（surjective）整（integral）态射（morphisms）。第二个使用本章前面讨论的性质 (A)、(B) 和 (C) 的相关材料。\n\n","allowed_english":["A","B","C"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effectivity","target_term":"有效性"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降理论，待决定。"},{"source_term":"effectivity","target_term":"有效性","context":"下降的性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"态射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"态射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"態射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"态射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整","context":"态射性质，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
